---
description:
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
- Always include type annotations for all parameters
- Use @click.pass_context for commands that need access to shared context
- Include detailed help messages for all options
- Handle exceptions with click.ClickException
- Return exit codes (0 for success, non-zero for failure)
- Use click.echo() for output to console
- Don't change existing config parameters without confirmation or extra analysis
- Write tests for each command and options that are added
